<title>NEW ZEALAND: Massachusetts Co reduces Sky City holding.</title>
<headline>Massachusetts Co reduces Sky City holding.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts Financial Services Company said in a notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange that it had ceased to be a substantial security holder in casino operator Sky City Limited on October 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Massachusetts Financial Services had reduced its relevant interest in Sky City to 4.93 percent from 8.22 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
